    <div class="reference-footer__top">
      <div class="reference-footer__brand"><a href="/" aria-label="Tribera home"><Logo variant="footer" /></a><p><strong>AI reads the signal. Senior experts add the judgment. You make the call.</strong> The bar is yours, and every candidate is held to the same one.</p><span>Tribe + Era</span><small><em>Belong</em> · Build · Become</small><div><a href="https://linkedin.com/company/triberaai">LinkedIn</a><a href="mailto:hello@tribera.ai">hello@tribera.ai</a></div></div>
      <nav><b>For hiring teams</b><a href="/#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/#the-bar">The bar</a><a href="/#guarantee">The guarantee</a><a href="/industries">Industries</a><a href="/functions">Functions</a></nav>
      <nav><b>For candidates</b><a href="/candidates">Create your profile</a><a href="/candidates">How it works</a><a href="/roles">Open roles</a><a href="/candidates#privacy">Privacy controls</a></nav>
